## Captured Requirements from 1.md and 44.md
### From 1.md (System Design Principles)
- **Distributed AI Infrastructure**: Build QMOI as distributed, modular, self-improving AI infrastructure (not single app). Must run local (offline), edge (prodice-level), cloud (server-level).
- **Architecture Requirements**: Use microservices architecture, event-driven system, API-first design.
- **Core Structure**: Implement qmoi/ with core/ subdirs: perception/, intent/, execution/, validation/, self_learning/, accessibility/, orchestration/; plus prodices/, os_adapters/, connectivity/, automation/, api/, monitoring/, live/, security/, voice/, memory/, deployments/.
- **Multi-Layer AI Engine**:
  - **Perception Engine**: Inputs from microphone, camera, system logs, sensors. Detect environment, prodice state, user context. Use edge + cloud hybrid for high-performance + accuracy.
  - **Intent Engine**: Parse voice, text, commands. Handle slang, typos, mispronunciations, mixed languages. Implement adaptive parsing layer.
  - **Execution Engine**: Control apps, prodices, machines, APIs. Auto-generate code, auto-deploy apps, auto-fix errors.
  - **Orchestration Engine**: Route tasks to local AI, cloud AI, external APIs.
- **Advanced Hands-Free System**: Follow accessibility standards (blind-first design). Implement natural voice engine with no strict commands, continuous listening.

### From 44.md (Enhanced Features)
- **Political Projects**: QMOI as manager for advertising, agendas, social media, TV, radio, internet to ensure user wins elections/nominations. Auto-research regions/countries for positions (president, governor, mayor, etc.). Manage social media accounts with auto-post feature (green/red indicator). Support all global social media platforms (Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, etc.).
- **UI Enhancements**: Auto-update stats/status in political projects. Customize UI based on position (e.g., president: counties list, polling stats, social/economic factors, previous presidents' weaknesses).
- **Access Control**: Only master, sister, and sponsored users can access political projects. Enhance sponsored list management with master instructions.
- **Masking Features**: QMOI auto-masks itself in auto-cloning, auto-research. Encrypt/decrypt everything, know when to use mask/VPN based on global laws/regulations. Ensure apps/websites show manipulative data when accessed by others.
- **NGROK Paid Features**: Add NGROKPAYED.md with at least 10 paid features (e.g., tunnel provisioning, master UI, auto-cloning). Auto-clone NGROK as alternative. UI in QI spaces for master only, fully autonomous.
- **Documentation & Testing**: Ensure ALLMDFILESREFS.md has all .md files. Add tests for everything, update ALLTESTSAUTOTESTS.md. Add hooks for everything, update HOOKS.md, WEBHOOKS.md, ALLHOOKSWEBHOOKS.md. Update TREE.md with developer structures. Update all related .md files for sponsored, master, sister, user, qvs, parallel, projects, auto projects, revenue, wallets, mask, evolution.
- **Evolution & Projects**: Add 10+ new project types. Enhance PRODUCTION window for all projects with auto-updates, stats display. Evolve QMOI in political, masking, NGROK features.
- Confirm `API.md`, `APIs_1.md`, `ENDPOINTS.md`, `ROUTES.md`, `TREE.md`, `ALLMDFILESREFS.md`, `ALLTESTSAUTOTESTS.md`, `HOOKS.md`, `WEBHOOKS.md`, and `ALLHOOKSWEBHOOKS.md` are all updated for this phase.

